# Never commit secrets or local state (audit fix, 2026-11-13): the
# deploy workflow publishes nearly everything in this repo to the
# public website, so anything committed here becomes public twice
# over - once on GitHub, once at gharlearn.com/<file>.
.env
.env.*
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.pem
*.key
.DS_Store
